{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】筲箕灣凌晨有電車出軌，無人受傷。</p><p>電車出軌後剷上行人路，撞向食店後停下，食店招牌被撞毀，吊臂車到場將電車移離。</p><p>警方凌晨近一時接報，一輛空載回廠電車在途中出軌，事件中無人受傷，警方正調查意外原因。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T00:58:41.348739+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T00:36:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T07:38:06.554522+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"872834df5d791190c9de983cb3a716148f2bda35654fcabfdb9e22301807a7bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}